# Web-AIOS — every variable here is OPTIONAL.
#
# Set a key to give visitors a working desktop without their own. A key entered
# in Settings → Providers always takes precedence over these.
#
# WARNING: /api/ai/chat has no authentication by design. On a public deployment,
# only set a key you are willing to have used by anyone who finds the URL — or
# leave these unset and let each visitor bring their own key.

OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
MISTRAL_API_KEY=
XAI_API_KEY=
TOGETHER_API_KEY=

# Ollama and LM Studio need nothing here: they are called directly from the
# browser, because a serverless function has no route to your localhost.
